        "finbert_scorer.py"
      ],
      "bsis:caveat": [
        "Two sentiment sources coexist — vendor `sentiment` and FinBERT `tone_*` — and they can disagree (`sentiment_conflict`). State which one a study used.",
        "`symbols_json` is an array, not a foreign key: join through `news_symbol_link`, never by string matching.",
        "Knowable only from `published_at`, never from the event described."
      ],
