      "bsis:writtenBy": [
        "jobHeartbeat.ts",
        "pythonRunner.ts"
      ],
      "bsis:caveat": [
        "`last_run_at` is the last ATTEMPT and `last_success_at` the last SUCCESS — a job can run nightly, fail nightly, and still look alive by the first column. Judge freshness on the second.",
        "Operational metadata: useful for lineage, never a model feature."
      ],
