      "bsis:caveat": [
        "`resolved_at` records when the mapping was created, not when it was last verified, so a mapping that has silently gone stale is indistinguishable from a fresh one.",
        "Uniqueness is not enforced (see the class caveat): a symbol->scid join can fan out after a vendor scrip merge."
      ],
